<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TAU">
<l>nīla maṇimiṭaṟṟa ṉīṇṭa caṭaimuṭiya</l>
<l>ṉūlaṇinta mārpa ṉutalviḻiyaṉ – ṟōluṭaiyaṉ</l>
<l>kaimmāṉ maṟiyaṉ kaṉaṉmaḻuvaṉ kaccālai</l>
<l>yemmā ṉimaiyōrk kiṟai.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>The man with a throat like the dark gem, possessing long matted locks,</l>
        <l>his chest adorned with a thread, having an eye on his forehead and an animal skin, holding a young stag in his hand and a fire-axe: our lord of Kaccālai is the supreme head of all the unblinking [gods].</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
